#: gtk/src/audiohandler.c
msgid "Fraunhofer's AAC encoder is not in this computer's FFmpeg"
msgstr "這台電腦的 FFmpeg 中沒有 Fraunhofer 的 AAC 編碼器"

#: gtk/src/audiohandler.c
#, c-format
msgid "Sparky Stereo OS may not pass on an FFmpeg built with it, so it is built on your own computer: install sparky-stereo-ffmpeg-fdk, then run sparky-stereo-ffmpeg-fdk in a terminal; it explains and asks first. Until then, a job with %s does not start."
msgstr "Sparky Stereo OS 不得散布含有該編碼器建置的 FFmpeg，因此需要在您自己的電腦上建置：請安裝 sparky-stereo-ffmpeg-fdk，然後在終端機中執行 sparky-stereo-ffmpeg-fdk；它會先說明並徵求同意。在此之前，使用 %s 的工作不會開始。"

#: gtk/src/stereo-preview.c
msgid "The start of this clip in the source is not known, so its views in turn cannot be paired: press play to encode it again."
msgstr "此片段在來源中的起始位置未知，因此無法將其交替出現的視圖配對：請按播放重新編碼。"

#: gtk/src/preview.c
msgid "The preview cannot be played"
msgstr "無法播放預覽"

#: gtk/src/preview.c
msgid "Playing the preview needs GStreamer's playback element (playbin), which is not installed. Install the package gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, then press play again."
msgstr "播放預覽需要 GStreamer 的播放元件 (playbin)，但它尚未安裝。請安裝 gstreamer1.0-plugins-base 套件，然後再按一次播放。"
